                <list>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>The withdrawal should be accomplished in three or four increments, each
                        large enough and sufficiently spaced to obtain news prominence and coverage.
                        The first increment, clearly the most important from a publicity viewpoint,
                        should therefore contain more colorful units, a wide spectrum of skills, and
                        representatives from all Services. The first increment is composed
                        tentatively of the following units:</item>
                </list>
                <table cols="3" rows="14">
                    <row role="label">
